### ============================================
### TEST: Verificar sintaxis explícita de foreign key en timeoffs
### ============================================
### Este archivo puede usarse con REST Client extension en VS Code
### O copiar las queries a Postman/Insomnia
### ============================================

### Variables (reemplaza estos valores)
@supabaseUrl = https://TU_PROYECTO.supabase.co
@anonKey = TU_ANON_KEY
@employeeId = TU_EMPLOYEE_ID
@companyId = TU_COMPANY_ID
@compensatoryTypeId = f2d92995-96a0-414f-b64a-9823db776745

### ============================================
### TEST 1: Query con sintaxis explícita (debería funcionar)
### ============================================
GET {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/timeoffs?select=*,type:timeoff_types(id,name),employee:employees!time_offs_employee_id_fkey(id,company_id)&employee_id=eq.{{employeeId}}&type_id=eq.{{compensatoryTypeId}}&is_approved=eq.true&employee.company_id=eq.{{companyId}}&order=date_from.desc
apikey: {{anonKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{anonKey}}

### ============================================
### TEST 2: Query sin sintaxis explícita (debería fallar con 300)
### ============================================
### Descomenta para probar que sin la sintaxis explícita da error:
# GET {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/timeoffs?select=*,type:timeoff_types(id,name),employee:employees(id,company_id)&employee_id=eq.{{employeeId}}&type_id=eq.{{compensatoryTypeId}}&is_approved=eq.true&employee.company_id=eq.{{companyId}}&order=date_from.desc
# apikey: {{anonKey}}
# Authorization: Bearer {{anonKey}}

### ============================================
### TEST 3: Query simplificada (solo para verificar sintaxis)
### ============================================
GET {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/timeoffs?select=*,type:timeoff_types(id,name),employee:employees!time_offs_employee_id_fkey(id,company_id)&limit=5
apikey: {{anonKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{anonKey}}

### ============================================
### TEST 4: Verificar que las foreign keys existen
### ============================================
### Esto requiere usar el SQL Editor de Supabase, no la API REST
### Ejecuta la query de test-timeoffs-query-syntax.sql (OPCIÓN 3)

